// Detection: Successful NSG or security rule write
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1562.007 (Disable or Modify Cloud Firewall), enables T1021.004
// Source: AzureActivity (diag-activity-log)
// Note: filter on "Success". Start/Accept rows are not the change itself.
// Next step: inspect Properties for the rule body (source, port) to alert only
//   on 0.0.0.0/0 or Internet on 22/3389. Run the last line to see what is captured

AzureActivity
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1h)
| where OperationNameValue has_any (
    "MICROSOFT.NETWORK/NETWORKSECURITYGROUPS/WRITE",
    "MICROSOFT.NETWORK/NETWORKSECURITYGROUPS/SECURITYRULES/WRITE")
| where ActivityStatusValue == "Success"
| project TimeGenerated, Caller, CallerIpAddress, OperationNameValue,
          _ResourceId, CorrelationId, Properties
// | extend Body = parse_json(tostring(Properties_d.requestbody))